  "content": "\n\n<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"191\" height=\"34\"></strong></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 完全重做的世界生成 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>)</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 完全优化并支持光影</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 超过150个任务</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 30+ 起源</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 6个新维度</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ RPG元素，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playerex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">等级提升</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-difficulty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态怪物难度</a></strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><strong>⚔️ 极具挑战性的独特首领 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction,</a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mariums-soulslike-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soulslike Weaponry</a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">)</a></strong></strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dehydration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">口渴</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmentz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">温度</a>系统</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 数千个全新地牢与建筑 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/choicetheorems-overhauled-village\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overhauled Villages</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a>)</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 深度定制以支持模组集成与兼容</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 沉浸式角色扮演与进度推进功能</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ 生活质量(QoL)功能，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-obelisk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">经验方尖碑</a></strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap</a> 集成新功能 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap-integration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap Integration</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mapfrontiers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Map Frontiers</a>)</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>⚔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f32754%252fmedieval-mc-fabric-mmc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">330+ 模组</a></strong></span></h5>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"235\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/stoegRhDQxY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4cwnhnrcCUw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方Minecraft产品。未经Mojang或微软批准或关联。</strong></span></h5>",
